When using the "libsrint" library, the minimum requirement is to set the initial value of the parameter.

These parameters are all integers and each group selects only one of the items.
These options can be determined by the keywords in the ZMAT file.


{Single precision : isd=1 ; prec=4 (%single in ZMAT file)
 or
 Double precision : isd=2 ; prec=8}


{totgpu=0 for invoke CPU 
 or
 totgpu=1 for invoke GPU (%gpu in ZMAT file)}


{cc_int = 1 for CFOUR 
        = 2 for amesp (%amesp in ZMAT file)
        = 3 for pyscf (%pyscf in ZMAT file)} 


logical ldebug for debug


